beards braids and blood transforming  into a viking isn't easy except for one  actress who was pretty much born for the  part find out who and so much more right  here  australian actor sam corlett portrays  the legendary explorer leif eriksen the  norseman whose thoughts were being the  first european to have set foot in north  america centuries before christopher  columbus in a promotional packet  provided to the press netflix describes  the ericsson of vikings valhalla saying  he's a greenlander raised on the outer  fringes of the known world who comes  from a tightly knit family steeped in  pagan beliefs it goes on to say that  although leif is an intrepid sailor and  physically tough he is also thoughtful  and often quiet and apparently  relatively new to the viking world which  is in the quote throes of violent change  when corlett was a teenager he actually  watched the original vikings with his  father so it's fitting that he would go  on to star in its spin-off the real-life  collette still has the long hair and  facial hair of his viking counterparts  but keeps it much more neatly trimmed  and styled than eriksen on set collette  who is vegan was costumed in vegan  leather armor to honor his personal  convictions  this is another distinct difference  between the actor and the character  he'll be portraying  one of the most beloved characters on  vikings was a shield maiden lagether  played by catherine winick so viewers  are likely eager to see another female  viking warrior rise up in the valhalla  character freydis eric stutter netflix's  description for freydis reads fiery and  headstrong freydis is a staunch believer  in the old gods and the fierce pagan  like her brother leif she reaches  katagat as an outsider but becomes an  inspiration to those of the old ways  freydis will be portrayed by swedish  model frieda gustafsson who has had an  impressive career walking in shows for  some of the world's most celebrated  designers as one might expect of someone  with gustofsten's professional  background her real-life look is much  more polished than the armored and  intricately braided freitas in what  feels like a cosmic coincidence  gustafsson's real-life nickname is also  freydis and her actual father and  brother are also named eric and leif  just like those of her character in the  show  vikings viewers will remember king  harold played by peter franzen who  appeared in season 4 through 6 of the  series as a leader determined to be  crowned king of all norway vikings  alhalla will follow one of his  descendants harold siegertsen who  carries the same ambition as his  ancestor his netflix bio reads born into  viking nobility herald is one of the  last viking berserkers and the prince of  norway intent on becoming king of norway  charismatic ambitious and handsome he is  able to unite both christian and pagan  vikings  keep an eye on him  harold would be portrayed by english  actor leo suter who bears very little  resemblance to his viking character  while harold sports the typical viking  look of a full beard and long hair  suitor typically tends to prefer going  clean-shaven and keeping his hair  cropped fairly short  some actors need to undergo greater  transformations than others for their  roles and vikings valhalla and actor  bradley friegard may be one of the least  altered for his role as king knut the  king of denmark the netflix press  materials describe knut saying a wise  savvy and ruthless viking leader he  keeps his friends close and his enemies  closer canoes ambitions will mould the  course of history in the 11th century  and make him a defining figure of the  viking age in real life welsh actor  fregaard doesn't look too remarkably  different from his character  both have dark hair and full beards  although knuts keeps his black hair long  and tightly pulled back while free guard  wears has cut shorts and allows some of  the natural grey to peek through  freegard also keeps his beard trimmed to  a much shorter length than canutes  canute's family play a central role in  vikings valhalla with his wife and  father also vying for power as knut  works to make sure denmark remains on  top of the political hierarchy  it wouldn't be a viking story without  feuding siblings and valhalla promises  that in space icelandic actor johannes  hokar johannesson portrays olaf  haraldson sigurdsson's older  half-brother and prince of norway olaf  is first in line for the norwegian  throne which we imagine will be a point  of contention between him and harold  olaf's netflix bio reads ambitious  unforgiving and a physical force to be  reckoned with olaf is also an extremely  devout christian viking  vikings viewers remember that the former  priest athelstan was the first  practicing christian to live among the  vikings although the conflict between  his beliefs and those of his viking  neighbors ultimately led to his death it  will be interesting to see how those  dynamics have shifted over a century  later in real life johannesson has kept  the long full beard of his character but  not his long hair preferring instead a  style that is cut closed on the sides  and slightly longer on top in addition  to being one of the main cast members of  vikings valhalla johannes hoga  johannesson is also an accomplished chef  the netflix press kit mentions that he  was frequently known to bring in  homemade baked goods for the stunt crew  during rehearsals  of the viking leader yao haken netflix's  press packet reads a great warrior and  tolerant leader harken rules katagat  with a steady hand though pagan she has  managed to keep katagata city open to  all faiths in a challenging time she  will become a powerful mentor to freydis  who is drawn to her wisdom of course we  know from watching ragnar's struggles  and vikings just how difficult it can be  to maintain peace between people of  different faiths in katagat so it will  be interesting to see how yall harken  manages to pull that off if such a thing  is even possible i want to be reunited  with my christian friend jalhakam will  be played by danish swedish singer  caroline henderson who is known  primarily for her more recent jazz  albums after previously singing mostly  pop y'all harkin is one of very few  viking women we've seen in promotional  materials who seems to wear her hair  loose more often than not so her normal  appearance is not quite as drastic of a  shift from her viking look as some of  her castmates  valhalla will feature the family of one  of alfred king of wessex's descendants  king eighth or red the second and a thor  red's wife emma of normandy this is what  the netflix press packet has to say of  emma the young ambitious emma of  normandy is from the norman court in  france and the viking blood she is now  married to king aethal red ii the  current king of england politically  astute and one of the wealthiest women  in europe queen emma is a sharp and  capable leader emma seems to follow in a  long tradition of shrewd queens on  vikings and is portrayed by german actor  and model laura berlin on valhalla  emma's hair is a dark brown but in real  life berlin's hair color has run the  full spectrum of colors from dark to  light and even a vibrant purple at one  point berlin has worked as a model since  she was a teenager making her no  stranger to the intricate costumes she  needs to wear as emma  described in netflix's press materials  for vikings valhalla as quote the  ultimate survivor david oaks's character  the earl of godwin serves as chief  counselor to the king of england 8th or  red ii of godwin's character the  description reads godwin was born on the  political fringes and is haunted by his  late father's mistakes cunning and savvy  he knows how to make powerful allies  godwin's portrayal is english actor  david oakes who is no stranger to  historical dramas thanks his work on  shows such as the borgias the white  queen and victoria  vikings introduced us to the 